# Credentials and private runtime configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*credentials*
*passwords*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
config/wazuh_indexer_ssl_certs/
